Nucleus dedicated JIT runner bootstrap

bootstrap.tmpl is adapted from CloudConfigTemplate in garm-provider-common
v0.1.9 (commit 0e7768ad59793cfaf3124434eeb290f02a52e6f7), as vendored by
garm-provider-lxd v0.1.5 (commit d234a9d9a2e0983a1a83ec12a75528eb1aeda648).

Copyright 2022 Cloudbase Solutions SRL
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see bootstrap.LICENSE.

Upstream source:
https://github.com/cloudbase/garm-provider-common/blob/0e7768ad59793cfaf3124434eeb290f02a52e6f7/cloudconfig/templates.go

The adaptation fixes the dedicated controller/account/proxy/version bindings,
requires JIT without tracing, preserves exclusive identity writes, rejects
nonempty Docker stores, and reports null Agent IDs without interpreting .runner.
It is the unchanged template accepted with GARM v0.2.1 and LXD provider v0.1.5
in the original single-job runtime validation:
SHA256 4ad03706a17eb260be188834aae901d222b685e1b8345c72d52c904243136bf2

The upstream project supplied no separate NOTICE file in this vendored package.
This file records attribution and the local adaptation; it does not imply
upstream endorsement or general production-pool acceptance.
